Third-party notices

This package does not bundle third-party source code. It pins and downloads:

  faster-whisper 1.2.1    MIT
  ctranslate2 4.8.3       MIT
  tokenizers 0.23.3       Apache-2.0
  onnxruntime 1.31.0      MIT
  huggingface_hub 2.3.0   Apache-2.0
  pilk 0.2.4              MIT

`wheels/pilk-0.2.4-cp312-cp312-win_amd64.whl` is a build of the MIT-licensed
pilk package, produced locally from its published source.

Speech models are downloaded by the user at runtime (Systran/faster-whisper-*),
not redistributed here; their licenses are governed by their own repositories.

